feathers on these babies.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.910
Like I can, the detail.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.013
It's just,

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.604
overwhelming.

00:11:49.604 --> 00:11:52.187
(upbeat music)

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:28.120
There's apparently like
hummingbird hats that you

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:31.180
can wear when they will
like feast out of your hat.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.860
This is new information to me.

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.200
I made this little note.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.900
It's a little bit weathered at this point,

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.010
but I made this for the gardener

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:40.500
because I didn't want them
to do any sort of gardening

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.370
on my fake grass that may
potentially disturb the babes.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.203
Cheers.

00:12:46.089 --> 00:12:49.922
(melancholy orchestral music)

00:12:51.824 --> 00:12:54.932
I'm so sad. I have to
end this video this way.

00:12:54.932 --> 00:12:56.580
(cries loudly)

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.716
This is (mumbles) that I
was so afraid of happening,

00:12:58.716 --> 00:13:02.220
and it did. I can't even walk outside.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.452
Something not (mumbles) last night.

00:13:04.452 --> 00:13:07.170
And unfortunately the
babies, they didn't make it.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.361
There's a clip of it on Twitch.

00:13:08.361 --> 00:13:10.560
Yes. I think something just cut up

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.992
either chopped down the
branch, and knocked it down.

00:13:13.992 --> 00:13:16.917
God, I hate it. (crying continues)

00:13:16.917 --> 00:13:20.750
(melancholy orchestral music)

00:13:24.371 --> 00:13:27.788
(melancholy piano music)

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:54.610
It's been like such a traumatizing week,

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:58.090
but coming out here and
still seeing Kiwi fly around

00:13:58.950 --> 00:13:59.883
and,

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.930
we might've spotted her with a boy.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:03.833
Hi, Kiwi.

00:14:04.739 --> 00:14:08.220
Oh my baby, oh I'm so happy to see her.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.070
It warms my heart.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.760
Like just seeing her still here.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.593
She hasn't left.

00:14:11.593 --> 00:14:14.340
She hasn't given up and
just kind of seeing her

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.173
move on,

00:14:15.173 --> 00:14:16.730
has sort of helped me move on.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.310
Like I know,

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:19.310
that some people apparently like,

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.143
This is crazy.

00:14:20.143 --> 00:14:21.440
How are you so invested in these birds?

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.640
I don't know, honestly, like
they, they captured my heart.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.650
They captured all of your guys' hearts

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:27.483
here on the internet.

00:14:27.483 --> 00:14:28.930
And I just love to show you guys Kiwi,

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:32.240
and show you that she's doing
well and she's still here.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:35.360
And we've seen her
flying around with a boy,

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:39.400
and I think she might be
looking for a new place to nest.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:42.250
So Kiwi, I think has moved on.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.680
I'm sure she's grieving as all of us have.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:47.330
It's definitely has
been a very tough week.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.290
I'm not going to lie.

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:50.900
It's just like trying to process it

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:54.330
and not sure if I should share
it with you guys or anything

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.860
but this video was so beautiful
and it was so special to me.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.090
So I'm so glad that you guys were able

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.830
to come along for this journey

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.540
and share Kiwi and her babies.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.237
And maybe, just maybe,
we'll have another nest.

00:15:05.237 --> 00:15:09.132
And I will protect that
nest with my own life.

00:15:09.132 --> 00:15:12.549
(melancholy piano music)

